    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Title: Food Escape</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this horror escape game, you play as Tamago-sama, the protagonist. To escape from the terrifying monster Mephis, you must react quickly and find escape routes. There is no exploration or combat involved; the focus is solely on running away, making it a simple yet thrilling game. Can you escape safely before becoming the monster's prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player Horror Escape Game</strong>: As food, you dedicate yourself to escaping from being eaten by the monster, aiming for the goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling Escape Mechanics</strong>: The gameplay demands quick escapes and evasion, without stealth or action elements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique dark and eerie art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time changing stage environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense BGM and sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rank logos prepared for each stage upon clearing them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new stages by clearing the previous ones</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Title: Food Escape</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this horror escape game, you play as Tamago-sama, the protagonist. To escape from the terrifying monster Mephis, you must react quickly and find escape routes. There is no exploration or combat involved; the focus is solely on running away, making it a simple yet thrilling game. Can you escape safely before becoming the monster's prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player Horror Escape Game</strong>: As food, you dedicate yourself to escaping from being eaten by the monster, aiming for the goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling Escape Mechanics</strong>: The gameplay demands quick escapes and evasion, without stealth or action elements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique dark and eerie art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time changing stage environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense BGM and sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rank logos prepared for each stage upon clearing them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new stages by clearing the previous ones</p></li></ul>",
